{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Chaos Into Optimized Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truck just arrived. Orders are piling up. Nothing is organized \u2014 yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Fulfillment Center Simulator</strong>, you run a growing warehouse operation where every shipment, layout decision, and workflow choice affects how efficiently your business runs. Start small, learn the flow of fulfillment, and transform operational chaos into a system that works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras/74d6dd583cd87daa1c1a017b64c69713.avif?t=1773355246\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras_big/74d6dd583cd87daa1c1a017b64c69713.avif?t=1773355246 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Efficiency Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no snap points and no perfect layouts, only smarter ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack pallets realistically, optimize storage space, and refine your workflow over time. Small improvements lead to massive gains as you learn how to move faster, think ahead, and eliminate bottlenecks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your warehouse evolves with your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras/847edbc7e57fa3edf7e1e00db48bf559.poster.avif?t=1773355246\" width=1170 height=568 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras/847edbc7e57fa3edf7e1e00db48bf559.webm?t=1773355246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras/847edbc7e57fa3edf7e1e00db48bf559.mp4?t=1773355246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Small Operation to Fulfillment Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with limited tools and tight space, then expand into a high-capacity logistics hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new equipment, handle larger shipments, and take on increasingly demanding contracts as order volume scales and pressure rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth isn\u2019t automatic. Efficiency drives success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras/0d9dc6666e756fb07c4e6b4968870a65.avif?t=1773355246\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/extras_big/0d9dc6666e756fb07c4e6b4968870a65.avif?t=1773355246 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Flow of Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success isn\u2019t about clicking menus, it\u2019s about movement, planning, and execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive and unload shipments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize and manage inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick, pack, and wrap orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize layouts for faster fulfillment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to rush periods and unexpected challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every improvement you make changes how your warehouse runs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3182990?t=1773355246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3182990?t=1773355246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182990/a64d8d0125156e5909a95f9cd486f48046745fe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773355246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam